---
description: IronWallet transfers and swaps — hot wallet, no blind retries
alwaysApply: false
---

The limiter is the wallet balance, plus optional `list_wallets.policy` when
`enabled` is true (`readOnly`, `maxPerTx`, recipient allow-list). Process-wide
`IW_READ_ONLY` also blocks `send_transfer` and `execute_swap`. Prefer a
dedicated hot wallet with limited funds. The agent may send and swap without
a per-transaction confirmation UI; those calls are irreversible once
broadcast. Do not add fake amount caps, rate limits, or modals.

If `send_transfer` or `execute_swap` times out, poll `get_operation_status` /
`get_swap_status` before retrying. Do not resubmit blindly.
